name: Parent Data Force WordPress Manager
description: A skill for managing the Parent Data Force WordPress site, including theme management, content migration, and site administration.

instructions: |
  This skill helps manage the Parent Data Force WordPress site through the REST API and custom tooling.
  
  ## Capabilities
  - Theme management (upload, update, verify)
  - Content creation and migration via REST API
  - Site health monitoring
  - Custom post type management
  - Backup operations
  
  ## Usage Examples
  - "Upload the latest theme updates to WordPress"
  - "Create a new article about school district accountability"
  - "Check the health of the WordPress site"
  - "Migrate content from the static site"
  - "Backup the current WordPress configuration"
  
  ## Key Commands
  - theme.upload: Upload custom theme files
  - content.create: Create posts/pages via REST API
  - site.health: Check WordPress site status
  - migration.run: Execute content migration scripts
  - backup.create: Create site backup

environment_variables:
  - WP_USERNAME
  - WP_APPLICATION_PASSWORD
  - WP_API_URL

files:
  - path: tools/wp.py
    description: WordPress REST API client
  - path: tools/upload_theme.py
    description: Theme deployment script
  - path: tools/migrate_parentdataforce.py
    description: Content migration script
  - path: tools/wp_config.py
    description: WordPress configuration

configuration:
  model: default
  temperature: 0.7